<title>FRANCE: Total sees deals with Gaz de France.</title>
<headline>Total sees deals with Gaz de France.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>French energy group Total SA said on Wednesday it was working on a number on unspecified deals with state-owned Gaz de France concerning gas exploration and transport activities.</p>
<p>But chairman Thierry Desmarest declined to confirm newspaper reports such deals could be signed in the next few weeks.</p>
<p>He told a news conference that a possible stake by Total in Gaz de France was &quot;not on the agenda&quot;.</p>
</text>
